{"id":"vod_sn_37141","vodId":"37141","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"鬼眼狂刀","name_cn":"鬼眼狂刀","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0f3aa5cb017ad7a10090ce930b1f1d75.jpg"},"summary":"《鬼眼狂刀》改编自上条明峰于1999年至2006年连载于《周刊少年magazine》的同名漫画。　　背着药，穿着太极衣的买药郎中壬生京四郎（小西克幸 配音）因为吃白食被官府悬赏一百文。“赏金侠女“椎名由夜（堀江由衣 配音）为了这一百文追踪京四郎，不负众望，终于成功将他拿下。不巧，在押送途中碰到京四郎原来的仇人找来寻仇，两人对战的时候,京四郎竟然爆发出一个由夜从未见过的陌生人格，而这个陌生人格的主人竟然是斩杀千人的通缉犯——鬼眼狂刀。原来壬生京四郎与鬼眼狂刀“狂”曾经进行过一次决斗，“狂”真正的肉身被封印在寒冰里，而灵魂则附在京四郎身上。故事也由此展开......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9uYVWcx2S51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iMPT7kF79q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cxuznQEMZb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M4h1EPmqgd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dgHgUvqCH41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ScmGNXiZh11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cCA4TuNVdA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sAuJrATzTx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KSBcwP5yNg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p6rkU36i271/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iBmtCF2Mwn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2RznsLfQiw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yeDftafAQ91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TH43VbfDA01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","ur